58	 * CARD AUTO-CHARGE + DUNNING
59	 *
60	 * A renewal applies wallet credit FIRST and auto-charges the saved card for the
61	 * remainder — the same split `lib/wallet-split.ts` gives checkout, so a renewal
62	 * behaves exactly like a purchase and prepaid/referral/refund credit gets drained
63	 * instead of accumulating as a liability.
64	 *
65	 * When the card fails the customer is NOT suspended. The card is retried on days
66	 * 1, 3 and 5 past expiry, each with its own email, and only once every attempt is
67	 * spent — plus one clear day after the final notice — does the server pause. The
68	 * old behaviour sent a customer with a perfectly good card straight to SUSPENDED
