58	// Customer per-server backup retention is now the backup TIER's keep count
59	// (lib/backup-tiers.ts): FREE keeps 2 (the historic default), PLUS keeps 7. Older
60	// archives are pruned after every successful backup so they never pile up.
61	// `resolveBackupKeep(tier, override)` is the single source; the paid Plus tier is
62	// the only thing that raises it above the old hardcoded 2.
