771	/**
772	 * Tell the customer their server failed to provision. Before this, a terminal
773	 * PROVISION failure flipped the server to ERROR and sent NOTHING — the customer
774	 * paid, then sat on a dead screen with a red dot and no explanation. Persists a
775	 * short human reason on `Server.provisionError` (surfaced in the ERROR banner on
776	 * the detail page), drops an in-app notification, and emails them. Best-effort on
777	 * every leg — a failed notification must never mask the underlying job failure.
